(7210761, 1108624, 60173, '<td valign="top">I love this style of processing. It has a calm, elegance. <br/> <br/>The composition felt a hair off at first. I had initially thought it could lose a tad from the top and the left, but when I tried cropping it that way the image lost some of its "space". Part of what she''s, in theory, enjoying is the solitude of being alone in a wide open field. Cropping the way I had initially felt to crop it focused too much on her. The field is as much a part of the image as she is.<br/> <br/>In summary, thanks for the composition lesson. Your composition is perfect.  :)</td>', 'I love this style of processing. It has a calm, elegance.  The composition felt a hair off at first. I had initially thought it could lose a tad from the top and the left, but when I tried cropping it that way the image lost some of its "space". Part of what she''s, in theory, enjoying is the solitude of being alone in a wide open field. Cropping the way I had initially felt to crop it focused too much on her. The field is as much a part of the image as she is. In summary, thanks for the composition lesson. Your composition is perfect.  :)', '2014-05-01 13:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
