(7212922, 1110876, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. Tonally and given the glow (and stonework), this looks like one of John''s<br/>2. A very evocative image that brings mixed emotions<br/>3. I think the image makes a connection - this is most acutely felt through the capture of her arthritic, oedematous hands<br/> <br/>Overall it''s a bold, slightly in-you-face image that communicates humanity well.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. Tonally and given the glow (and stonework), this looks like one of John''s2. A very evocative image that brings mixed emotions3. I think the image makes a connection - this is most acutely felt through the capture of her arthritic, oedematous hands Overall it''s a bold, slightly in-you-face image that communicates humanity well.', '2014-05-05 16:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7212925, 1109196, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 9s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. Utterly fabulous composition<br/>2. Superb colours<br/>3. Very interesting main character<br/>4. Such light!<br/> <br/>Marvellous.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 9s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. Utterly fabulous composition2. Superb colours3. Very interesting main character4. Such light! Marvellous.', '2014-05-05 16:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7212926, 1111222, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 9s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. Perhaps over-crisp for some but I really enjoy this high-structure look.<br/>2. Superb composition<br/>3. The applied vignette matches the scene well<br/>4. The cyclist adds a vital splash of dynamism.<br/>5. Great tones.<br/> <br/>A very enjoyable image.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 9s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. Perhaps over-crisp for some but I really enjoy this high-structure look.2. Superb composition3. The applied vignette matches the scene well4. The cyclist adds a vital splash of dynamism.5. Great tones. A very enjoyable image.', '2014-05-05 16:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7212927, 1108624, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 9s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. I love the low contrast look of this - I''m never brave enough to do it.<br/>2. I love the compositional contrast between the pristine model and the murky background.<br/>3. I''m fascinated by how calm, comfortable and serene she looks despite her precarious perch.<br/>4. I like the overall oddness of the scene.<br/> <br/>Lovely stuff.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 9s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. I love the low contrast look of this - I''m never brave enough to do it.2. I love the compositional contrast between the pristine model and the murky background.3. I''m fascinated by how calm, comfortable and serene she looks despite her precarious perch.4. I like the overall oddness of the scene. Lovely stuff.', '2014-05-05 16:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7212929, 1110835, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. Not my usual cup of tea but this is so well constructed, it got me to stop and look.<br/>2. Nailed focus - crucial in a shot like this.<br/>4. A complete lack of motion unsharpness too - again, crucial.<br/>5. Great colours counterpointing the largely monochromatic water.<br/>6. Killer reflection.<br/> <br/>A technical tour de force.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. Not my usual cup of tea but this is so well constructed, it got me to stop and look.2. Nailed focus - crucial in a shot like this.4. A complete lack of motion unsharpness too - again, crucial.5. Great colours counterpointing the largely monochromatic water.6. Killer reflection. A technical tour de force.', '2014-05-05 16:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7212930, 1111217, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. Bold and bright composition that works perfectly<br/>2. Such delicacy in the pelicans<br/>3. Sharp where it needs to be<br/>4. Well controlled exposure<br/>5. Great balance in your elements.<br/> <br/>Distinguished by its precise construction. Very well made.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. Bold and bright composition that works perfectly2. Such delicacy in the pelicans3. Sharp where it needs to be4. Well controlled exposure5. Great balance in your elements. Distinguished by its precise construction. Very well made.', '2014-05-05 16:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7212931, 1111329, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. Excellent leading lines adds a lot of depth.<br/>2. The geometric elements give the shot a graphic art feel - I like that.<br/>3. I like the unposed pose.<br/>4. Great tones.<br/>5. Excellent rendition of a tricky high contrast scene.<br/> <br/>Very nice work.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. Excellent leading lines adds a lot of depth.2. The geometric elements give the shot a graphic art feel - I like that.3. I like the unposed pose.4. Great tones.5. Excellent rendition of a tricky high contrast scene. Very nice work.', '2014-05-05 16:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7212933, 1111381, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: <br/> <br/>1. I love the ''aha'' moment the mirror offers and thus the humanity that is levered into the scene.<br/>2. I admire the prominence of the expanse of sky.<br/>3. I love that overhang at the top.<br/>4. The slightly flat tones serve your composition perfectly.<br/>5. The wide-angle induced ''dutch angle'' is highly effective.<br/> <br/>Eclectic and bold. I like it a lot.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:  1. I love the ''aha'' moment the mirror offers and thus the humanity that is levered into the scene.2. I admire the prominence of the expanse of sky.3. I love that overhang at the top.4. The slightly flat tones serve your composition perfectly.5. The wide-angle induced ''dutch angle'' is highly effective. Eclectic and bold. I like it a lot.', '2014-05-05 16:37:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7212936, 1111461, 100393, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1051747" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Awarded for the April Free Study.<br/> <br/>This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: <br/> <br/>1. This is an astonishing image - like a movie scene. Such intensity.<br/>2. I''ve been watching ''24'' from the beginning (it''s new to me) and have noticed the shooting through the scenery camera shots - that covert feeling is captured here too.<br/>3. Nailed focus and exposure - I''m guessing you didn''t have too long to compose either.<br/>4. Fabulous and well-balanced composition - what an angle you have.<br/>5. Super tones - perfect choice for this image.<br/> <br/>Outstanding photograph. I''m looking forward to finding out who shot this.</td>', '  Awarded for the April Free Study. This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:  1. This is an astonishing image - like a movie scene. Such intensity.2. I''ve been watching ''24'' from the beginning (it''s new to me) and have noticed the shooting through the scenery camera shots - that covert feeling is captured here too.3. Nailed focus and exposure - I''m guessing you didn''t have too long to compose either.4. Fabulous and well-balanced composition - what an angle you have.5. Super tones - perfect choice for this image. Outstanding photograph. I''m looking forward to finding out who shot this.', '2014-05-05 16:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
