(7213931, 1111481, 67258, '<td valign="top">I love the apparent interaction between subjects and photographer - there is so much to see here, and so many tales to tell.  The man lying on the mat adds a strong sense of contrast - the brightness of the women, both in clothing and projected personality to the greyness and dejection of the prone form. Inntriguing and, I suspect, a social commentary to unravel.  A phot to return to.</td>', 'I love the apparent interaction between subjects and photographer - there is so much to see here, and so many tales to tell.  The man lying on the mat adds a strong sense of contrast - the brightness of the women, both in clothing and projected personality to the greyness and dejection of the prone form. Inntriguing and, I suspect, a social commentary to unravel.  A phot to return to.', '2014-05-07 14:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
