(7213944, 1110876, 67258, '<td valign="top">I don''t know whether this is a posed shot, or a ''found'' one - I would be delighted if it was the latter, but in any event, it is a cracking photograph.  It makes me long to know something of the lady''s story.</td>', 'I don''t know whether this is a posed shot, or a ''found'' one - I would be delighted if it was the latter, but in any event, it is a cracking photograph.  It makes me long to know something of the lady''s story.', '2014-05-07 15:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
