(7214122, 1111349, 30049, '<td valign="top">Love the capture.  Appears that you had to bring some detail back in the undersides, evident by the noise.</td>', 'Love the capture.  Appears that you had to bring some detail back in the undersides, evident by the noise.', '2014-05-07 21:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7214123, 1110864, 30049, '<td valign="top">As much as I like this I think I''d like more.  Meaning ... just a smidge off the left and a little off the top would have given us a bit more bird and detail. You had a conundrum with keeping the water movement left of the bird and not getting too tight perhaps.  Just guessing.  Also, I really want to add more room to the right ... the direction the bird is moving into.  Makes the composition feel awkward.  Sorry.  Like it - want to like it more.  :-)</td>', 'As much as I like this I think I''d like more.  Meaning ... just a smidge off the left and a little off the top would have given us a bit more bird and detail. You had a conundrum with keeping the water movement left of the bird and not getting too tight perhaps.  Just guessing.  Also, I really want to add more room to the right ... the direction the bird is moving into.  Makes the composition feel awkward.  Sorry.  Like it - want to like it more.  :-)', '2014-05-07 21:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7214124, 1111419, 167257, '<td valign="top">very pretty</td>', 'very pretty', '2014-05-07 21:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
